id: marked-mark
name: Marked
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: what Enhanced Search (5) leaves on the one it won against - its clock the Searcher's, read against them
# (chat.mjs markedParts; hidden.mjs hideFrom).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Marked: the Searcher's Strike and Dodge Rolls 1(T) higher against you, and you cannot become Hidden from them, till the
  start of their next turn.
text: >
  Enhanced Search (5): If you win, that Character becomes ‘Marked’ until the start of your next turn. Increase your Strike and Dodge Rolls against a ‘Marked’ Character by 1(T) and a ‘Marked’ Character cannot become Hidden from you.

---
